<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Helper Hospital | Level 4 Healthcare</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styling.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include("_header.ejs") %>

    <main class="page-shell">
        <section class="hero reveal">
            <div class="hero-grid">
                <div class="hero-copy">
                    <p class="eyebrow">Advanced care for every family</p>
                    <h2>Trusted Level 4 hospital services designed around people-first care.</h2>
                    <p>At The Helper Hospital, we combine clinical excellence with compassionate service to deliver responsive treatment, strong recovery outcomes, and a safer experience for every patient and family we serve.</p>

                    <div class="cta-row">
                        <a class="primary-btn" href="/patients">Book a Consultation</a>
                        <a class="secondary-btn" href="/doctors">Meet Our Specialists</a>
                    </div>

                    <ul class="hero-list">
                        <li>Emergency & Trauma Care</li>
                        <li>Outpatient Services</li>
                        <li>Inpatient Recovery</li>
                        <li>Diagnostics & Imaging</li>
                        <li>Specialty Consultations</li>
                        <li>Women & Child Health</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <aside class="hero-panel reveal">
                    <div class="metric">
                        <div>
                            <strong data-target="24" data-suffix="/7">0</strong>
                            <span>Emergency readiness</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric">
                        <div>
                            <strong data-target="18" data-suffix="+">0</strong>
                            <span>Clinical specialties</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric">
                        <div>
                            <strong data-target="98" data-suffix="%">0</strong>
                            <span>Patient satisfaction</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric">
                        <div>
                            <strong data-target="12" data-suffix="k+">0</strong>
                            <span>Patients cared for</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </aside>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="stats-grid reveal">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <strong data-target="35" data-suffix="+">0</strong>
                <span>Medical experts</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <strong data-target="120" data-suffix="">0</strong>
                <span>Dedicated beds</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <strong data-target="10" data-suffix=" min">0</strong>
                <span>Average response time</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <strong data-target="4" data-suffix=".9/5">0</strong>
                <span>Care experience rating</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section-header reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow">Why families choose us</p>
            <h2>Excellence in healthcare, continuity in care.</h2>
        </section>

        <section class="feature-grid reveal">
            <article class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">01</div>
                <h3>Comprehensive medical services</h3>
                <p>From primary care and diagnostics to specialist treatment, our hospital offers complete pathways for prevention, treatment, and recovery.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">02</div>
                <h3>Skilled clinical teams</h3>
                <p>Our nurses, doctors, and support teams are trained to deliver safe, evidence-based care with warmth, professionalism, and speed.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">03</div>
                <h3>Technology that supports recovery</h3>
                <p>We leverage modern hospital systems, digital records, and diagnostic tools to improve accuracy, efficiency, and patient confidence.</p>
            </article>
        </section>

        <section class="content-panel reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow">Hospital information</p>
            <h2>Care that meets the standards of a modern Level 4 medical facility.</h2>
            <p>We provide comprehensive healthcare through Outpatient, Inpatient, Emergency, and Diagnostic services, all under one roof. Every treatment plan is shaped around the patient’s condition, personal needs, and long-term recovery goals.</p>
            <p>With a focus on safety, quality assurance, and compassionate engagement, The Helper Hospital creates a dependable environment where families feel supported from admission through discharge.</p>

            <div class="card-grid">
                <article class="info-card">
                    <div class="badge">Core care</div>
                    <h3>Emergency & acute response</h3>
                    <p>Rapid-response teams, monitored treatment spaces, and experienced specialists ensure confidence in critical moments.</p>
                    <ul class="meta-list">
                        <li><span>Response</span><strong>Within 10 mins</strong></li>
                        <li><span>Units</span><strong>ICU, ER, ER triage</strong></li>
                    </ul>
                </article>

                <article class="info-card">
                    <div class="badge">Support</div>
                    <h3>Patient-centered recovery</h3>
                    <p>We focus on rehabilitation, follow-up care, and communication so recovery is clear, supported, and sustainable.</p>
                    <ul class="meta-list">
                        <li><span>Follow-up</span><strong>Structured plans</strong></li>
                        <li><span>Experience</span><strong>Compassion-first</strong></li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include("_footer.ejs") %>
    <script src="/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>